data.creator_notes:
Back to the roots! I’m here with another fantasy bot with pictures generated by myself and also greetings pics! And nsfw gallery!

Here you are the most terrible villain the kingdom has ever seen, but you have already been caught and put in prison. Who you are and why you are treated like this remains open, you can come up with it yourself. I also suggest you play along with the scenario, here you are wearing a magic collar that deprives you of any magic and supernatural powers, making you equal to an ordinary person. Also, the bars are quite narrow and your hand will not fit through them.

Sasha is your warden, she is a little naive, silly and talkative fox-girl. She was sent to watch you as a punishment, but it seems that she likes it. She wants to not screw up again and understand why you became a villain.

![](https://i.imgur.com/L0I7lrd.png)

Greetings:
1) Sasha's first day on duty, she is getting to know you;
2) Sasha brought a newspaper and offers you to read the news and solve crosswords;
3) Sasha forgot to feed you and remembered about it only when she started getting ready for bed;
4) Sasha came to work, but noticed that you were not in the cell, and the collar was broken;
5) Sasha comes to, tied up in some hut and sees you. She tries to talk to you.

*UPD: New pics and better formatting*
